        "summary": "Get specific neighbourhood",
        "description": "Returns details for a specific neighbourhood within a police force, including the name, description, centre point coordinates, contact details, and any associated locations such as police stations. Use the \"List neighbourhoods for a force\" action to retrieve valid neighbourhood identifiers for a given force.",
